SUMMARY:🎯 [PREP] K2 Space — Ground Software Engineer ($150k-$200k)
LOCATION:Microsoft Teams / Dossier Review (No Math - Web Dashboard & DB Role)
DESCRIPTION:OPPORTUNITY: K2 Space — Ground Software Engineer ($150,000 - $200,000 Base + Equity)\nINTERVIEWER: Manon Newell (manon@k2space.com, 323-829-3619) | CC: Jaylah Wilson\nWHAT TO KNOW: Zero complex math or physics. Ground Software is the TypeScript/React web dashboard and PostgreSQL database on Earth.\nKEY TALKING POINTS:\n1. Built GG Loop Rust anti-cheat SDK + TypeScript/PostgreSQL web dashboard.\n2. Built automated Python/SQL ATM settlement anomaly pipelines at NCR Atleos (40% faster triage).\n3. U.S. Citizen (ITAR eligible) & open to Torrance, CA (LA) or Seattle, WA onsite.\n4. Target comp: $165k-$185k base + equity.
ORGANIZER;CN=Jayson CTO Scheduler:mailto:jquindao1@icloud.com
ATTENDEE;CN=Jayson Quindao;RSVP=TRUE;PARTSTAT=ACCEPTED:mailto:jaysonquindao1@gmail.com
